window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Espionage, enemies, and matchmaking mayhem!</b></p> <p>Gerri Wilder and the Matchmaker's Book Club are at it again with their biggest challenge yet. Armed with the desire for grandchildren and a sharp eye for love, these determined mamas are set on pairing two headstrong competitors with each other. This one could blow up in their faces!</p> <p>Elliot \"Ellie\" Madden, a thirty-one-year-old visionary game developer, is more adept at navigating virtual worlds than the complexities of love. She's perfectly content with her solo life... until a fiercely competitive and devastatingly handsome tiger shifter challenges her to a duel that stirs more than just her gamer spirit.</p> <p>Zyan Ashford, CEO of a leading gaming empire and a powerful tiger shifter, is equally uninterested in romance—despite his family's gentle prods towards finding a mate. However, his encounter with the sharp-witted and alluring Ellie at a gaming convention sparks a fiery attraction he can't deny.</p> <p>As their professional competition blossoms into a steamy, secretive romance, danger looms. When Ellie becomes the target of corporate espionage, Zy's protective instincts surge to the forefront. He must balance his fierce desire to protect her with finding out who's behind the stolen code, all while a sinister threat tries to tear apart their newly forged bond.</p> <p><i>Dive into a whirlwind of flirtatious competitions, heartfelt connections, and perilous secrets in this paranormal rom-com. Get ready for heart-pounding action, laugh-out-loud moments, and a love story that proves even the fiercest competitors can be perfect allies in love and war.</i></p>"; 
